      "question": "A tree's height H m, t years after planting, satisfies H^3 = pt^2 + q. At t = 3, H = 2. At t = 5, H = 2.4. Find p and q to 3 significant figures where necessary.",
      "status": "ready",
      "answer": "p = 0.364, q = 4.72 (3 s.f.)",
      "steps": [
        "Substitute t = 3, H = 2: 8 = 9p + q.",
        "Substitute t = 5, H = 2.4: 2.4^3 = 13.824 = 25p + q.",
        "Subtract the first equation from the second: 16p = 5.824.",
        "So p = 0.364.",
        "Then q = 8 - 9(0.364) = 4.724, so q = 4.72 to 3 s.f."
      ],
