      "question": "A rectangular pitch has x > y, with x + y = 175 and xy = 7350. Hence find the values of x and y.",
      "status": "ready",
      "answer": "x = 105, y = 70",
      "steps": [
        "From x + y = 175: y = 175 - x.",
        "Substitute into xy = 7350: x(175 - x) = 7350.",
        "Rearrange: x^2 - 175x + 7350 = 0.",
        "Discriminant = 175^2 - 4(7350) = 30625 - 29400 = 1225 = 35^2.",
        "x = (175 +/- 35)/2 = 105 or 70.",
        "Since x > y, x = 105 and y = 70."
      ],
